The Warrior was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a powerful 7/8 for only 6G, but with the drawback of dealing 4 DMG to itself when played, effectively making it 7/4. '''Beta 54.1''' gave it +1 HP, but also made it deal +1 DMG to itself, keeping its effective stats the same.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 7

HP:

* 8 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 9 (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

Cost: 6

Abilities:

* Magic: Deal 4 DMG to itself. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Magic: Deal 5 DMG to itself. (Post Beta 54.1, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
